# Nexus AI Search Engine

An AI-powered research engine using:
- Multi-query RAG pipeline
- Google CSE for web retrieval
- Ollama (local LLM)
- FAISS vector database

## Features
- Query decomposition
- Parallel web search
- Semantic retrieval
- Structured research reports

## Tech Stack
Python, LangChain, Streamlit, FAISS, Ollama
